Partition changes:
- Read the saved time offset from /mnt/vendor/persist/time as well as
  /persist/time, so the clock does not start at 1970.
- Before unmounting a partition, unmount anything mounted below it first
  (longest path first), so the unmount does not fail with EBUSY.

diff --git a/partition.cpp b/partition.cpp
index 5185200f2..9ad1c2062 100644
--- a/partition.cpp
+++ b/partition.cpp
@@ -1,3 +1,7 @@
+#include <android-base/strings.h>
+#include <algorithm>
+#include <memory>
+#include <mntent.h>
 /*
